      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'm not going to lie, the new black hole leave animation is huge and super bright in a dark world\n\nAnd the confetti is loud and annoying\n\nI would love for the ability to shut off items or leave/join animations in the shield settings for all but friends or for everyone\n\nIf, when I click the animation or item, an option for disabling all of that effect or item was possible, that would be very useful\n\n(Example: I would turn off the confetti and black hole for everyone because I find them disruptive at quiet or dark events\n\nI would turn off all leave/join animations for everyone who isn't a friend\n\nI would also turn off all items for people who are visitors, new users, or users)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
